# Teferi, Time Raveler's +1: "Until your next turn, you may cast sorcery spells as though they had flash." Bot1 casts
# Teferi off a Tundra and two Moxen and uses the +1 at once. On Bot2's upkeep (turn 2), where Duress's own sorcery
# timing is out of reach (CR 307.1), Bot1 casts Duress off Mox Jet and it resolves, taking Bot2's Lightning Bolt.
# A cast line matches only when the prompt offers it, so the Duress line itself proves the permission.

[Bot1 Deck]
Tundra
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Teferi, Time Raveler
Duress
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Tundra.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Teferi, Time Raveler.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Tundra.Activate(Ability: {U})
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Teferi, Time Raveler.Activate(Ability: +1)
[T2 Bot2.Upkeep]
Bot1.Hand.Duress.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)

[Expect]
Turn = 2
Step = Upkeep
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Duress
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Battlefield.Teferi, Time Raveler.Counters.Loyalty = 5
